<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns first two credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns first two credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has assigned two of the four credit auctions whereby it sought to inject 4.938 billion pesos in the secondary market on Monday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM     AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    1.312 bln  14 days  31.39 pct</p>
<p>    1.313 bln   9 days  31.42 pct</p>
<p>    1.313 bln   8 days</p>
<p>    1.000 bln   1 day</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559</p>
